# TandemMind AI 

TandemMind AI is cohort-based training for digital community managers to explore responsible, practical uses of AI in their daily work.

We identify real community management problems and opportunities, develop use cases, test potential solutions, and turn what works into reusable resources for community professionals.

## Who this is for

Digital community managers and professionals in closely adjacent roles who directly support community work.

## What we're exploring

- Community management use cases for AI
- Workflows and automation
- AI-assisted community operations
- Agents and agentic workflows
- Documentation and knowledge management
- Community research and insights
- Responsible AI practices and guardrails

## How we work

**Problem first. Technology second.**

We start with the community problem or opportunity, define the use case and requirements, and then determine the appropriate solution.

That solution might be a prompt, workflow, automation, agent, template, documentation—or no AI at all.

> If the use case ain't lit, don't commit.
